PUBLIC DOMAIN DEDICATION

The ancient Tamil poems contained in this repository (Shivavakkiyam, Thiruneetru Pathigam,
Natarajar Pathu, Shiva Puranam, Arathi, and related texts) are classical religious and
philosophical literature that have been part of Tamil cultural heritage for centuries.

These works have existed in the public domain since their creation and remain so. This
repository dedicates these texts to the public domain under the Creative Commons Zero
License (CC0 1.0), allowing anyone to:

  • Use these texts freely for any purpose
  • Modify, remix, or adapt the content
  • Download, copy, and redistribute in any format
  • Use commercially or non-commercially
  • No attribution required (though it is appreciated)

This dedication waives all copyrights, related rights, and claims to the extent permitted
by law, recognizing the texts as part of humanity's shared cultural and spiritual heritage.

For more information on the CC0 license:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

These are timeless spiritual texts freely available to all for learning, devotion, and
cultural preservation.
